{{!
    @template block_coursecare/overview_item

    One measured row of the overview page: a name (with a link when there is one), the size, the share
    in text and a decorative bar of the same share.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * name, hasurl, url - what is measured
    * size, share - size and share as text
    * width - share in percent for the decorative bar
    * help - optional explanation sentence

    Example context (json):
    {
        "name": "Reading 1",
        "hasurl": true,
        "url": "https://example.com/mod/resource/view.php?id=7",
        "size": "2.0 MB",
        "share": "38%",
        "width": 38
    }
}}
<li class="block_coursecare-overview-item">
    <div class="block_coursecare-overview-itemtext">
        <span class="block_coursecare-overview-itemname">{{#hasurl}}<a href="{{url}}">{{name}}</a>{{/hasurl}}{{^hasurl}}{{name}}{{/hasurl}}</span>
        <span class="block_coursecare-overview-itemvalue">{{size}} · {{share}}</span>
    </div>
    {{#help}}
    <p class="block_coursecare-overview-help mb-0">{{help}}</p>
    {{/help}}
    <div class="block_coursecare-overview-bar" aria-hidden="true"><span style="width: {{width}}%;"></span></div>
</li>
